10
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
Bel Canto is a 2018 American drama film directed by Paul Weitz,
from a screenplay by Weitz and Anthony Weintraub.

11
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
It is based on the 2001 novel of the same name by Ann Patchett.

12
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
It stars Julianne Moore, Ken Watanabe, Sebastian Koch, and Christopher Lambert.

13
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
It was released on September 14, 2018 by Screen Media Films.

14
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
